        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom semi-detached property to the market, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Raheen development in Tallaght, Dublin 24.\nNo. 69 Raheen Road offers spacious living accommodation of approximately 96 sq.m, comprising of an inviting entrance hallway, a generous lounge, and a bright and airy kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs features three well-proportioned double bedrooms, an ensuite leading from the master and a main family bathroom.\nWhile in need of some modernisation and TLC, No. 69 presents a fantastic opportunity for buyers to create a truly stunning family home. The property will qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, making it an even more attractive prospect for those looking to renovate, with huge potential throughout.\nFurther benefits include a generous low maintenance rear garden, a generous driveway to the front and a detached garage positioned to the side of the property. The garage offers excellent versatility and could be utilised for a variety of purposes, including additional storage, a home office, gym, workshop or conversion.\nRaheen is a well-established and highly regarded development, offering a peaceful residential setting while being within easy reach of a wealth of local amenities, including schools, shops, sports facilities, and excellent transport links.\nNo. 69 is sure to generate strong interest from a wide range of buyers, including first-time purchasers and investors alike.\nEarly viewing is highly advised—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information!\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>96 sq m</li>\n <li>3 bed, 2 bath</li>\n <li>Semi-detached</li>\n <li>Garage to the side</li>\n <li>Offering fantastic potential for a truly stunning family home</li>\n <li>Qualifies for vacant home grant</li>\n <li>Built c.1972</li>\n <li>Close to a host of amenities, schools & transport links</li>\n <li>Low maintenance rear garden</li>\n <li>Driveway to the front</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly advised!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
